#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: stripe-mobilepay-woocommerce.php
msgid "Stripe MobilePay for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Stripe MobilePay for WooCommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: stripe-mobilepay-woocommerce.php
msgid "Unofficial MobilePay payment method for WooCommerce on your existing Stripe account (through the official WooCommerce Stripe Payment Gateway): reserved at checkout, captured when the order is completed. Requires the WooCommerce Stripe Payment Gateway plugin by WooCommerce (https://wordpress.org/plugins/woocommerce-gateway-stripe/), connected to your Stripe account: its API keys are used."
msgstr "Uofficiel MobilePay-betalingsmetode til WooCommerce på din eksisterende Stripe-konto (via det officielle WooCommerce Stripe Payment Gateway): beløbet reserveres i kassen og trækkes, når ordren er gennemført. Kræver pluginnet WooCommerce Stripe Payment Gateway fra WooCommerce (https://wordpress.org/plugins/woocommerce-gateway-stripe/), forbundet til din Stripe-konto: dets API-nøgler bruges."

